<title>POLAND: PEKPOL TURNS TO PLN 0.2 MLN LOSS IN Q2.</title>
<headline>PEKPOL TURNS TO PLN 0.2 MLN LOSS IN Q2.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
